{"id":"corriente","lemma":"corriente","pos":"adj","rank":1455,"glosses":["flowing, running","current (existing or occurring at the moment)","common, usual"],"ipa":"/koˈrjente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"corrientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-corriente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Abrí una cuenta corriente.","en":"I opened a checking account.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152119"},{"text":"Estamos al corriente de eso.","en":"We're aware of that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455263"},{"text":"Estamos al corriente del problema.","en":"We're aware of the problem.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611823"},{"text":"Toda la ciudad está al corriente.","en":"The whole town knows about it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610746"},{"text":"Intentamos meterle corriente a mi camión.","en":"We tried to jump-start my truck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845489"}]}